{"id":"824ea1d54ff527bd","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-decidable-set.md","title":"Decidable Set","display":"df-decidable-set — Decidable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-decidable-set","aliases":["89-df-decidable-set"],"display":"df-decidable-set — Decidable Set","depends_on":["[[89-df-effective-computation]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-decidable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-decidable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable-set — Decidable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3997bfb78544d69c\" href=\"?note=3997bfb78544d69c\" title=\"89-df-effective-computation\">89-df-effective-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}\\)</span> 在自然数输入输出上使用无 oracle 的有限寄存器程序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Decidable}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\}\\in\\mathsf{Rec}^{\\varnothing}_1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Decidable}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ [\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (f(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Decidable}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\}\\in\\mathsf{Rec}^{\\varnothing}_1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Decidable}(A)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ [\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (f(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条补齐本书实际使用但原压缩包未提供的基础接口；不恢复或冒充其他书籍的原文件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-effective-computation","status":"resolved","id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Decidable}(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\{\\langle a\\rangle\\mid a\\in A\\}\\in\\mathsf{Rec}^{\\varnothing}_1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Decidable}(A)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f:\\omega\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ [\\operatorname{Comp}(f)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (f(n)=1\\leftrightarrow n\\in A)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":942,"backlinks":[{"id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]、[[89-df-decidable-set]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-decidable-set]]"}],"outgoing":["3997bfb78544d69c"]}